msgid "The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them."
